codex
The asymmetry is real in the current source: IRQEnable computes its result and then calls `exit(1)`; FIQEnable falls through with a zero result despite tracking an enable mask. I found the datasheet in the project-level `_scratchpad`; it distinguishes the readable Enable register from the write-only EnableClear register.
