The datasheet makes zero correct at reset, but FIQEnable must reflect the stored mask once configured. There’s also a false premise in Q3: this tree’s `memory_rw` device-failure branch has MIPS and M88K handling, with no ARM abort arm. I’m checking the ARM caller and existing probes to pin down that limitation.
